{"id":"14G","title":"General Health Laws","part":{"n":14,"title":"Food and health laws"},"url":"/law/14-food-and-health-laws/14g","entries":[{"id":"14G.1","text":"Those with a plague or contagious diseases are to be quarantined.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":13,"verses":"5,21,46"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":5,"verses":"2-3"}],"citation":"Lev. 13:5, 21, 46; Num. 5:2-3."},{"id":"14G.2","text":"He that touches the dead body of any man shall be unclean seven days.","refs":[{"book":"Numbers","chapter":19,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Num. 19:11."},{"id":"14G.3","text":"Lepers are to be cleansed.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":14,"verses":"1-32"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":24,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Lev. 14:1-32; Deut. 24:8."},{"id":"14G.4","text":"A house occupied by one having a plague or contagious disease is to be cleaned and disinfected.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":14,"verses":"34"}],"citation":"Lev. 14:34:57."},{"id":"14G.5","text":"For him that is sick, let him call for the elders of the church, and let them pray over him.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":5,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"James 5:14."},{"id":"14G.6","text":"Laws of purification.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"1-22"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":31,"verses":"19-24"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:1-22; Num. 31:19-24."},{"id":"14G.7","text":"The prayer of faith will save the sick, and the Lord will raise him up.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":5,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"James 5:15."},{"id":"14G.8","text":"Laws concerning contact with dead or unclean things.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":11,"verses":"24-40"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":21,"verses":"1-4,11"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":9,"verses":"6,10"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":19,"verses":"11-22"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":31,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Lev. 5:2; Lev. 11:24-40; Lev. 21:1-4, 11; Num. 5:2; Num. 9:6, 10; Num. 19:11-22; Num. 31:19."},{"id":"14G.9","text":"Garments worn by one who has a contagious disease are to be burned.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":13,"verses":"52,55,57"}],"citation":"Lev. 13:52, 55, 57."},{"id":"14G.10","text":"All things that touch a dead unclean animal must be cleansed with water and allowed to set until evening.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":11,"verses":"32-38"}],"citation":"Lev. 11:32-38."},{"id":"14G.11","text":"Those who are sick or have a contagious disease shall not conceal their condition but are to alert others as to their condition.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":13,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Lev. 13:14."},{"id":"14G.12","text":"Health and healing come from obedience to the word and law of God.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":15,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":41,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"1-8"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":4,"verses":"20-22"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":30,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":33,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Hosea","chapter":6,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Exod. 15:26; Exod. 23:25; Deut 7:15; Psa. 41:3; Prov. 3:1-8; Prov. 4:20-22; Jer. 30:17; Jer. 33:6; Hos. 6:1."},{"id":"14G.13","text":"God puts disease and sickness on those who will not heed his commandments and keep his statutes.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":15,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":26,"verses":"14-16"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":28,"verses":"27,35,61"}],"citation":"Exod. 15:26; Lev. 26:14-16; 2 Deut. 28:27, 35, 61."},{"id":"14G.14","text":"Chron. 21:12-15, 18;","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":26,"verses":"16-21"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":11,"verses":"30"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 26:16-21; 1 Cor. 11:30."}]}